  "answer": "**Opened:** `game-console.component.ts` → `openInventory()` calls `this.dialog.open(InventoryComponent, { data, panelClass: 'inv-dialog-panel', maxHeight: '90vh' })`.\n\n**Data passed:** `InventoryDialogData = { characterId: this.characterId, sessionId: this.sessionId }`, injected via `MAT_DIALOG_DATA` in `inventory.component.ts`.\n\n**API calls it makes** (via `GameApiService`, `inventory.component.ts`):\n- `getInventory(characterId)` → `GET /api/character/{characterId}` (on init)\n- `equipItem(characterId, itemId, equipped)` → `PATCH /api/character/{characterId}/equip`\n- `dropItem(characterId, itemId)` → `DELETE /api/character/{characterId}/inventory/{itemId}` (used for both dropping and \"using\" potions)\n\nNote: healing from potions is computed client-side and never persisted server-side (known bug B-05).",
